OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening and night, and after a dry
OL,7,Fstart over the southeast, there will
OL,8,Fbe outbreaks of rain which may turn
OL,9,Fheavy at times especially across
OL,10,FArgyll and some other western high
OL,11,Fground. Mull drier later A mild night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy start with some rain,
OL,14,Fbut brighter drier weather soon
OL,15,Freaching Argyll will extend to all
OL,16,Fareas by afternoon, with some
OL,17,Fsunshine. The odd shower is possible
OL,18,Facross Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
