OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry, bright with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and some hazy sunny spells.
OL,8,FChance of showers on Wednesday.
OL,9,FBecoming warm or very warm.
